    title: "​​USS Lincoln finally docks in San Diego after 10-month mission",
    summary: "The US aircraft carrier was set to return in May but the war with Iran has kept it at sea on one of the longest deployments ever.",
    preview: "USS Lincoln finally docks in San Diego after 10-month mission Families have welcomed home the thousands of crew members on board the USS Abraham Lincoln after the warship spent more than 300 days at sea. The aircraft carrier docked in San Diego after one of the longest deployments ever recorded, where it had been supporting the US-Israel war with Iran. BBC Verify has been tracking its time at sea - as Jake Horton reports. Produced by Krystal Campos. Graphics by Mark Edwards.",
    body: "USS Lincoln finally docks in San Diego after 10-month mission\n\nFamilies have welcomed home the thousands of crew members on board the USS Abraham Lincoln after the warship spent more than 300 days at sea.\n\nThe aircraft carrier docked in San Diego after one of the longest deployments ever recorded, where it had been supporting the US-Israel war with Iran.\n\nBBC Verify has been tracking its time at sea - as Jake Horton reports.\n\nProduced by Krystal Campos. Graphics by Mark Edwards.\n\nRelated topics\n\n- Iran warUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- United StatesUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- IranUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- MilitaryUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- US Armed ForcesUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.",
